# Session Summary: 2026-01-12 - "The Swarm & Outcome Realization"

## Overview
Today's session focused on closing the loop between the **Nucleus Runtime** (Swarm Orchestration) and the **GentleQuest App** (Clinical Utility). We successfully moved from theoretical swarm logic to persistent, observable, and clinically-integrated features.

## Work Stream 1: Swarm Orchestration & Persistence (Phase 6)
- **Problem**: Swarms would "forget" their missions if the orchestrator instance restarts.
- **Solution**: Implemented [_save_state()](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/orchestrator.py#40-48) and [_load_state()](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/orchestrator.py#31-39) in [SwarmsOrchestrator](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/orchestrator.py#8-157). 
- **HUD Integration**: Added `/api/swarms` to [app.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/app.py) to allow the HUD to visualize these persistent missions.
- **Verification**: Confirmed persistence via [tests/test_swarm_persistence.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tests/test_swarm_persistence.py).

## Work Stream 2: Repository Hygiene & Polish (Phase 7)
- **Action**: Archived [agent_manager.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/agent_manager.py) (legacy flywheel).
- **Documentation**: Synchronized [backlog.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/backlog.md), [task.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/7c654df4-b83e-43f9-8620-f15868ec39d1/task.md), and created [RELEASE_NOTES_V0_5_0.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/7c654df4-b83e-43f9-8620-f15868ec39d1/RELEASE_NOTES_V0_5_0.md).
- **Handoff Logic**: Hardened the "Swarm Relay" for autonomous Planning -> Execution transitions.

## Work Stream 3: Outcome Dashboard Integration (Phase 8b)
- **Goal**: Connect HUD to real GentleQuest assessment data.
- **Implementation**:
    - **Config**: Split `API_URL` (Brain) and `APP_API_URL` (App).
    - **Frontend**: Refactored [NucleusWellnessChart.tsx](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/tools/nucleus-hud/app/components/outcome/NucleusWellnessChart.tsx) to handle dynamic API fetching, session selection, and GAD-7/PHQ-9 metric toggling.
- **Verification**: Verified endpoint `/api/assessment/history` support in [app.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/app.py).

